Package: EpitoScope
Title: Interactive QC, Visualization, and Immunogenicity Assessment of Immunopeptidomics Data
Version: 0.9.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Yannic", "Chen", , "yannicchn@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An interactive R/Shiny application that unifies quality control,
    visualization, comparative statistics, and MHC class I/II binding
    prediction for mass-spectrometry-based immunopeptidomics data. It ingests
    search-engine outputs from PEAKS, FragPipe, DIA-NN, and Spectronaut through
    a configurable column-mapping layer, and provides publication-ready figure
    export and relational storage of processed results and binding predictions.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/yannic-chen/EpitoScope
BugReports: https://github.com/yannic-chen/EpitoScope/issues
